    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That dastardly cat Mr. Skritch has trapped your birdie friends inside magical gems - and now he's cackling with glee! Join Sandy on a delightful treasure hunt across the enchanting Komio Island to rescue every single Bird-Buddy before Skritch's mischievous minions cause even more trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 hand-crafted worlds where curiosity is rewarded and every corner hides a surprise. From hidden passages to secret powerups, this cozy adventure celebrates the joy of discovery rather than punishing precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of wonderfully weird abilities - bounce with Bubble-Seeds, stomp with Bomb-Boots, electrify with Mag-Zaps, wreck everything with Axe-Bones or gallop on Dashing Ponies. The ultra-rare ScootyCopter awaits the most dedicated explorers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an army of adorable troublemakers as you climb toward the ultimate showdown atop Mt. Skritch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome love letter to classic platformers, lovingly crafted by a solo developer with a passion for colourful worlds full of surprises.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That dastardly cat Mr. Skritch has trapped your birdie friends inside magical gems - and now he's cackling with glee! Join Sandy on a delightful treasure hunt across the enchanting Komio Island to rescue every single Bird-Buddy before Skritch's mischievous minions cause even more trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 hand-crafted worlds where curiosity is rewarded and every corner hides a surprise. From hidden passages to secret powerups, this cozy adventure celebrates the joy of discovery rather than punishing precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of wonderfully weird abilities - bounce with Bubble-Seeds, stomp with Bomb-Boots, electrify with Mag-Zaps, wreck everything with Axe-Bones or gallop on Dashing Ponies. The ultra-rare ScootyCopter awaits the most dedicated explorers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an army of adorable troublemakers as you climb toward the ultimate showdown atop Mt. Skritch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Komio Island</i> is a bright, wholesome love letter to classic platformers, lovingly crafted by a solo developer with a passion for colourful worlds full of surprises.</p>",
    "short_description": "An evil cat trapped your birds in magical gems! Ride ponies, master quirky powerups, and explore a whimsical island packed with secrets in this lovingly crafted solo indie platformer.",
